From 3f6870b998e79a790bb5fc05abf0ef67328a375b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AyeedShaikh <ayeedxec@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] scudo: Add a FreeBSD platform for bionic

Use native FreeBSD calls for memory, synchronization, random data and
platform services. Keep the Android allocator configuration and the
existing default memory classes. Replace released pages with zeroed
anonymous mappings because MADV_FREE can keep old contents.

Use the public _umtx_op interface and Android allocator logging.
Count resident pages with mincore and the FreeBSD MINCORE_INCORE bit.
Keep the other platforms' default query unchanged.
